### mosgarage API — REST Client test file
### VS Code: install "REST Client" extension, then click "Send Request" above each block
### Set the active environment via Ctrl+Shift+P → "REST Client: Switch Environment"

@baseUrl = http://localhost:7070
@token   = {{login.response.body.token}}

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# AUTH
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Health check (no auth)
GET {{baseUrl}}/healthz
Accept: application/json

###

### Auth config — which auth method is active?
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/config
Accept: application/json

###

### Local login → captures JWT as @token
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/local-login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email":    "admin@mosgarage.local",
  "password": "changeme"
}

###

### Me — current user info
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# WORKSPACES
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### List workspaces
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workspaces
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Create workspace
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workspaces
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name":            "my-workspace",
  "templateId":      "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "autoStop":        true,
  "autoStopMinutes": 120
}

###

### Get workspace by ID (replace with real ID from create response)
@workspaceId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Start workspace
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/start
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Stop workspace
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/stop
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Get workspace tunnel URL
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/tunnel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Delete workspace
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SYSTEM
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Swagger JSON
GET {{baseUrl}}/swagger/v1/swagger.json
Accept: application/json

###

### SignalR negotiate (workspace hub)
POST {{baseUrl}}/hubs/workspace/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
